   <text>
      <body>
         <div type="letter">
                <div type="mainBody">
                    <ab>
                        <address>
                            <addrLine>Hotel Richemond</addrLine>
                            <addrLine>
                                <name type="geo" key="G_CHE_GENE">Geneva</name>
                            </addrLine>
                        </address>
                    </ab>
                </div>
                <div type="mainBody">
                    <p>Very worried &amp; busy these last weeks. Please wait for reply. Hope <name type="person" key="sarg81">S.</name> <seg xml:id="seg1" type="note-anchor">saw oculist</seg>.</p>
                    <closer>                 <signed>
                            <name type="person" key="joyc82">J.J.</name>
                        </signed>
                        <dateline>
                            <date when="1933-08-02">2.8.933</date>
                        </dateline>
                    </closer>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div type="notes">
                <note xml:id="note1" target="#seg1" type="commentary">In an unpublished section of his <rs type="letter" key="L_70335">letter of 17 July 1933</rs> to Budgen (<name type="work">LI</name> 336–37), JJ recommended a London oculist for Budgen’s friend, <name type="person" key="sarg81">Louis Sargent</name>.</note>
            </div>
      </body>
